msgstr ""
"the site is under version control, so WordPress will not overwrite its own "
"files"

#: includes/backports.php:657
msgid "Security patch status"
msgstr "Security patch status"

#: includes/backports.php:735
msgid ""
"The configured policy permits minor updates, the updater looks operable, and "
"this is the release WordPress would install, so it should arrive on a "
"scheduled check. That is not a guarantee: WP-Cron still has to run."
msgstr ""
"The configured policy permits minor updates, the updater looks operable, and "
"this is the release WordPress would install, so it should arrive on a "
"scheduled check. That is not a guarantee: WP-Cron still has to run."

#. translators: 1: release core would install, 2: the same-line patch.
#: includes/backports.php:741
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are running here, but WordPress would install %1$s rather "
"than %2$s: it takes the highest release the settings permit, not the "
"nearest. This patch will not arrive on its own. If you want it, you'll need "
"to install it manually."
msgstr ""
"Automatic updates are running here, but WordPress would install %1$s rather "
"than %2$s: it takes the highest release the settings permit, not the "
"nearest. This patch will not arrive on its own. If you want it, you'll need "
"to install it manually."

#: includes/backports.php:748
msgid ""
"Automatic updates appear to be available, but Keel could not determine which "
"release WordPress would install next, so nothing here establishes that this "
"patch is scheduled."
msgstr ""
"Automatic updates appear to be available, but Keel could not determine which "
"release WordPress would install next, so nothing here establishes that this "
"patch is scheduled."

#: includes/backports.php:751
msgid ""
"Automatic updates appear to be available, but WordPress is not selecting a "
"release to install, so this patch is not scheduled."
msgstr ""
"Automatic updates appear to be available, but WordPress is not selecting a "
"release to install, so this patch is not scheduled."

#: includes/backports.php:786
msgid ""
"None of these will install on their own, because the updater cannot act "
"here. Keel will not offer a deliberate install from this screen until that "
"is cleared; a deployment workflow or WP-CLI may still be able to perform the "
"update."
msgstr ""
"None of these will install on their own, because the updater cannot act "
"here. Keel will not offer a deliberate install from this screen until that "
"is cleared; a deployment workflow or WP-CLI may still be able to perform the "
"update."

#: includes/backports.php:789
msgid ""
"None of these will install on their own while automatic updates are held "
"back here. That does not prevent a deliberate install."
msgstr ""
"None of these will install on their own while automatic updates are held "
"back here. That does not prevent a deliberate install."

#: includes/backports.php:793
msgid "Keel could not determine which of these WordPress would install."
msgstr "Keel could not determine which of these WordPress would install."

#. translators: %s: version WordPress would install.
#: includes/backports.php:799
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WordPress would install %s and skip the rest. It does not step through them "
"one version line at a time."
msgstr ""
"WordPress would install %s and skip the rest. It does not step through them "
"one version line at a time."

#: includes/backports.php:811
msgid ""
"None of these will install on their own. Something is declining every one of "
"them, which may be this site's update settings or a requirement the offers "
"do not meet. If it is a requirement, Keel will refuse a deliberate install "
"for the same reason."
msgstr ""
"None of these will install on their own. Something is declining every one of "
"them, which may be this site's update settings or a requirement the offers "
"do not meet. If it is a requirement, Keel will refuse a deliberate install "
"for the same reason."

