msgstr ""
"Nothing will install on its own while the updater cannot act, whatever core "
"would otherwise select. Keel will not offer a deliberate install of %s from "
"here until that is cleared."

#. translators: %s: target version.
#: includes/backports.php:1279
#, php-format
