msgstr ""
"WordPress is not scheduling %s: it is not in this site's cached list of core "
"updates yet. Automatic updates are running here, so a later check may pick "
"it up. Installing it deliberately requires an offer for it, which this site "
"does not currently hold."

#. translators: %s: target version.
#: includes/backports.php:1323
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WordPress is not currently scheduling %s, although it is among the releases "
"this site has been offered. Automatic updates are running, so something is "
"declining this particular release. It can be installed deliberately from the "
"command line."
msgstr ""
"WordPress is not currently scheduling %s, although it is among the releases "
"this site has been offered. Automatic updates are running, so something is "
"declining this particular release. It can be installed deliberately from the "
"command line."

#. translators: %s: target version.
#: includes/backports.php:1330
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Reaching %s means either letting automatic updates resume, or installing it "
"deliberately from the command line."
msgstr ""
"Reaching %s means either letting automatic updates resume, or installing it "
"deliberately from the command line."

#: includes/backports.php:1344
msgid "You are not allowed to change update settings on this site."
msgstr "You are not allowed to change update settings on this site."

#. translators: %s: WordPress version.
#: includes/backports.php:1408
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WordPress %s has known vulnerabilities, and every release on this line is "
"flagged the same way. Moving to a maintained line is the only remedy."
msgstr ""
"WordPress %s has known vulnerabilities, and every release on this line is "
"flagged the same way. Moving to a maintained line is the only remedy."

#. translators: 1: current version, 2: patched version.
#: includes/backports.php:1420
