msgstr ""
"WordPress %1$s has known vulnerabilities. The nearest release without known "
"vulnerabilities is %2$s, on this same line. Automatic updating appears to be "
"available; Site Health shows which release WordPress would actually install."

#. translators: 1: current version, 2: patched version, 3: reasons.
#: includes/backports.php:1427
#, php-format
