"This site is running a release with publicly known vulnerabilities. %s fixes "
"them and stays on the same release line."
msgstr ""
"This site is running a release with publicly known vulnerabilities. %s fixes "
"them and stays on the same release line."

#. translators: 1: release WordPress would install, 2: patched release on this line.
