"WordPress would install %1$s and skip %2$s. It takes the highest release "
"your settings allow rather than the nearest, so the fix for the line you are "
"on is passed over."
msgstr ""
"WordPress would install %1$s and skip %2$s. It takes the highest release "
"your settings allow rather than the nearest, so the fix for the line you are "
"on is passed over."

#. translators: 1: release the Updates screen is offering, 2: patched release on this line.
#: includes/updates-screen.php:154
